{"id":"porque","lemma":"porque","pos":"adv","rank":40,"glosses":["why, what for, for what reason (introduces a question)","why (for which cause, reason, or purpose; introduces a subordinate clause)","Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see por, que, and usage notes"],"ipa":"/ˈpuɾ.kɨ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3c/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Waldyrious-porque.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Waldyrious-porque.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Vim porque quis.","en":"I came because I wanted to.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187728","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},null,{"g":"to want","l":"querer"}]},{"text":"Porque és tão esperto?","en":"Why are you so smart?","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"ser"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"smart, intelligent"}]},{"text":"Faço isso porque quero.","en":"I do that because I want to.","words":[{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"to want","l":"querer"}]},{"text":"Estou aqui porque quero.","en":"I'm here because I want to be.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"to want","l":"querer"}]},{"text":"Porque eles foram?","en":"Why didn't they go?","words":[null,{"g":"they"},null]}]}